Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}1955.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An American educational film shows a doctor, a small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:07.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}child, and a vaccination.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 821 0 l 821 132 l 0 132{\p0}
