Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}"IMMUNIZATION" · ENCYCLOPAEDIA BRITANNICA FILMS
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1955
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:10.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}For thousands of years, smallpox was one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:12.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}deadliest diseases on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On average, about 3 in 10 people who caught it died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:19.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}As late as 1967, according to a history of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:22.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}eradication campaign, it was still causing an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}estimated 10 to 15 million cases a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:29.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Ten years later, the last natural case was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today, it doesn't exist in nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:35.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It is the only human infectious disease that has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}ever been wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:40.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So how do you erase a disease from an entire planet?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.81,0:00:38.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.81,0:00:38.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.81,0:00:38.56,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USAMRIID · BIOSAFETY LEVEL 4 · 2020
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.81,0:00:38.56,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMY BIODEFENSE LAB · FORT DETRICK, MARYLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And people noticed something early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:17.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}If you survived smallpox, you were protected from
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}catching it again.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.31,0:01:18.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 547 0 l 547 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:12.31,0:01:18.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:12.31,0:01:18.06,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ANIMATION · HOW IMMUNITY WORKS
Dialogue: 3,0:01:12.31,0:01:18.06,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1955
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}About half a century later, it became a question of war.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:17.77,0:02:21.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 717 0 l 717 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:17.77,0:02:21.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:17.77,0:02:21.33,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MILITARY HEALTH SYSTEM PODCAST · 2026
Dialogue: 3,0:02:17.77,0:02:21.33,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HISTORIAN DR. DALE SMITH · USU
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:47.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So, on February 6, 1777, George Washington wrote to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:50.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}his medical director, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}William Shippen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Military Health System calls the strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}largely successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.31,0:03:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The English doctor Edward Jenner had noticed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}something about dairymaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:24.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The ones who had caught cowpox, a disease they
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:27.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}picked up from cows, seemed to be immune to smallpox.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.56,0:03:23.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 547 0 l 547 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:17.56,0:03:23.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:17.56,0:03:23.31,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ENCYCLOPAEDIA BRITANNICA FILMS
Dialogue: 3,0:03:17.56,0:03:23.31,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1955
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:39.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He repeated the experiment on other children,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}including his own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:44.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Within twenty years of his findings being published,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}his work had been translated into Portuguese,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:49.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}French, Dutch, Italian and Japanese.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.28,0:03:43.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 547 0 l 547 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:37.28,0:03:43.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:37.28,0:03:43.03,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ENCYCLOPAEDIA BRITANNICA FILMS
Dialogue: 3,0:03:37.28,0:03:43.03,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1955
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:21.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In this 1955 film, smallpox vaccine production
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}starts with calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then the vaccine is processed in a lab, and sealed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}into tiny glass tubes.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.77,0:04:24.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 502 0 l 502 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:18.77,0:04:24.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:18.77,0:04:24.52,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SMALLPOX VACCINE PRODUCTION
Dialogue: 3,0:04:18.77,0:04:24.52,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1955
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:29.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:33.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Smallpox was eliminated from North America in 1952.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Europe followed in 1953.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:38.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But in much of the world, smallpox was still everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They needed better tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The first was the vaccine itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}During the program, only heat-stable, freeze-dried
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:36.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}vaccine was used.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.98,0:05:34.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 738 0 l 738 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:28.98,0:05:34.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:28.98,0:05:34.73,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. AIR FORCE TRAINING VIDEO · 2018
Dialogue: 3,0:05:28.98,0:05:34.73,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SMALLPOX VACCINE VIALS · MODERN
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}According to the National Library of Medicine, it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}needed a quarter of the vaccine used before, almost
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}every vaccination took, and after sterilization,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}each needle could be reused up to a hundred times.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.39,0:05:50.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 931 0 l 931 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:44.39,0:05:50.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:44.39,0:05:50.14,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. AIR FORCE TRAINING VIDEO · 2018
Dialogue: 3,0:05:44.39,0:05:50.14,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MODERN VACCINE PREP · NOT 1960S PRACTICE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:46.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}There was one more death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1978, a medical photographer at a medical school
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:53.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}in Birmingham, England, caught smallpox and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The CDC says her infection was traced to the medical
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:08:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}school building, where smallpox research was being done.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.21,0:07:50.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:45.21,0:07:50.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:45.21,0:07:50.96,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY LAB · 2020 · NOT BIRMINGHAM
Dialogue: 3,0:07:45.21,0:07:50.96,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}BSL-4 SUIT DECONTAMINATION SHOWER · USAMRIID
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:44.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The World Health Organization inspects both
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}repositories every two years, and keeps an emergency
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:51.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}stockpile of smallpox vaccine, in case the disease
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:52.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}ever returns.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:41.78,0:08:47.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1060 0 l 1060 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:41.78,0:08:47.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:41.78,0:08:47.53,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USAMRIID · BSL-4 · FORT DETRICK, MD · 2020
Dialogue: 3,0:08:41.78,0:08:47.53,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMY BIODEFENSE LAB, NOT A SMALLPOX REPOSITORY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Labs that study the most dangerous viruses work like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:59.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Full-body suits, connected to a supplied air line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:00.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This one is the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:04.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Army's infectious disease institute at Fort Detrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Maryland.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.83,0:08:58.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 802 0 l 802 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:52.83,0:08:58.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:52.83,0:08:58.58,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAINING LABORATORY · 2020
Dialogue: 3,0:08:52.83,0:08:58.58,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}BSL-4 PPE DEMONSTRATION · USAMRIID
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:08.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Founded in 1969, it's the only Defense Department
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:11.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}lab equipped to safely study highly hazardous
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}viruses at the highest containment level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:17.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Separately, according to the Army, it ran the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}pivotal trial that led to FDA approval of another
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}smallpox vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}After the attacks of September eleventh, and the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}anthrax letters, the Pentagon reassessed the threat
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:30.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}that smallpox could be used as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:52.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A newer vaccine followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:55.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2007, the FDA approved ACAM2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:58.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was derived from an older vaccine, Dryvax, which
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}was grown on the skin of calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The new one is grown in cell culture.
