Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Vaccination is still part of military life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This is a seasonal flu vaccine drive, at Camp
